    #   U_g1 = k_1 × μ_s(t, ρ_vac,[SCm]) × ∇(M_s/r) × e^(-αt) × cos(πt_n) × (1 + δ_def)
    #   
    #   The (1 + δ_def) factor introduces:
    #     • Time-dependent correction to internal gravitational field
    #     • Small oscillatory deviations (±1%)
    #     • Captures imperfections/perturbations in idealized field
    #
    # PHYSICAL INTERPRETATION:
