# NAVIER-STOKES UQFF INTEGRATION (23Feb2026) - SUPERGROK4 DERIVATION
# From: SuperGrok4 NS-UQFF Analysis
# Madelung transformation, NS emergence from UQFF-NDFE, MHD extensions
